::GitBash::
This GitBash command places a file in the staging area.
{
=git add
~git commit
~git push
~git place
}

::GitBash::
This GitBash command snapshots a file permanently in the version history.
{
~git add
=git commit
~git push
~git version
}

::GitBash::
This GitBash command sends the committed changes of the main branch to your remote repository. 
{
~git add
~git commit
=git push
~git place
}

::GitBash::
This GitBash command fetches and merges changes on the remote server to your working directory.
{
=git pull
~git commit
~git push
~git add
}
